{"seq":2,"slug":"hot-recent-personal","title":"热搜、历史与个性化建议的来源与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-autocomplete-suggestion/suggestion-types/hot-recent-personal","wordCount":3528,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"热搜-历史与个性化建议的来源与生命周期\">热搜、历史与个性化建议的来源与生命周期</h1><p>凌晨两点，某个跨境平台东南亚市场的热搜榜第三位是一条拼写错误的 query——因为前一天晚上一位拥有百万粉丝的主播在直播里口误，几十万用户跟着搜了同一个错词。第二天早上它必须消失，否则整个品类页会被一条噪声 query 占领。这个场景说明了热搜类候选的根本性质：<strong>它们是有生命周期的、会冲突的、可能被操纵的实时数据</strong>，而不是一张查一次就完事的静态表。</p>\n<p>本文的主题是三类非前缀来源的建议——热搜（trending）、用户历史（recent）、个性化（personalized）——在跨境场景下的采集、聚合、衰减、去重、隐私与冷启动处理。它们与<a href=\"../suggestion-types/prefix-completion-assoc\">前缀补全</a>共享同一个下拉框，但工程性质完全不同：前缀补全可以离线构建、强缓存、结果对所有人一致；这三类则要求实时、因人而异、并且要能<strong>在出现问题时被快速关闭</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类来源的共同结构与差异\">核心概念：三类来源的共同结构与差异</h2><p>把三类来源放在一张表里，差异立刻清晰：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>热搜</th>\n<th>历史</th>\n<th>个性化</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据主体</td>\n<td>全体用户（按市场切分）</td>\n<td>当前用户设备</td>\n<td>当前用户画像/行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间尺度</td>\n<td>小时级衰减</td>\n<td>天到月</td>\n<td>周级画像 + 实时会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发条件</td>\n<td>输入为空或极短</td>\n<td>输入为空（聚焦即出现）</td>\n<td>输入非空（重排已有候选）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私性质</td>\n<td>公开聚合，无个体信息</td>\n<td>个体数据，存本地优先</td>\n<td>个体数据，服务端画像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动表现</td>\n<td>无冷启动问题</td>\n<td>新设备为空</td>\n<td>新用户退化为热搜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要风险</td>\n<td>被操纵、被敏感事件绑架</td>\n<td>泄露隐私、共享设备串号</td>\n<td>兴趣窄化、跨市场迁移错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个设计结论从这张表直接推出。</p>\n<p><strong>结论一：三者的存储位置不同。</strong> 热搜是服务端全局数据；历史首选<strong>设备本地存储</strong>（客户端，如 Web 的 <code>localStorage</code>——按 origin 隔离、无过期时间、会话结束后仍保留），服务端不落库（来源：MDN <code>Window.localStorage</code>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/localStorage\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/localStorage</a>）；个性化画像是服务端数据但必须可删除。把历史也放服务端看似方便（跨设备同步），代价是它成了 PII 存储，需要处理跨境传输与删除请求——在 GDPR 语境下，数据主体的删除权（第 17 条&quot;被遗忘权&quot;，要求控制者&quot;不得无故延迟&quot;地删除个人数据）正是这个代价的合规基线，它远高于跨设备同步的收益，除非用户明确开启同步（来源：GDPR Article 17, <a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-17-gdpr/\">https://gdpr-info.eu/art-17-gdpr/</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论二：三者的失效策略不同。</strong> 热搜需要&quot;一键下架某条&quot;的运营能力与自动的异常检测（某条 query 增速超过阈值的 N 倍时先自动降权再人工确认）；历史需要&quot;清空历史&quot;按钮与过期自动淘汰；个性化需要&quot;为什么给我看这个&quot;的可解释性与关闭开关。</p>\n<p><strong>结论三：三者最终都要经过同一条排序管道。</strong> 来源不同，但输出必须是一个统一的候选列表（见<a href=\"../suggestion-types/prefix-completion-assoc\">前缀补全、联想词与直达</a>中的 <code>suggest_candidate</code> 契约），带统一的分数数量纲与来源归因。因此本文的重点不是&quot;每个来源怎么算分&quot;，而是<strong>如何把它们归一化成可比的候选</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"热搜-用变化率而非绝对值定义-热\">热搜：用变化率而非绝对值定义&quot;热&quot;</h2><p>热搜的第一版实现通常按检索次数取 top-10，结果是<strong>榜单永不变化</strong>——大品类的头部 query 永远占据前几名，任何新趋势都进不来。正确做法是按变化率定义热度，即前文给出的</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mn>24</mn><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">trend(q) = \\frac{freq_{24h}(q) + \\alpha}{freq_{7d}(q)/7 + \\alpha}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">24</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的行为符合直觉：一条 query 昨天 0 次、今天 100 次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">trend \\approx (100+\\alpha)/\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 取小值（典型 1 或 5）就能得到极高的分，直接冲上榜首；一条 query 每天稳定 10 万次，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">trend \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，永远上不了榜。<strong>热搜榜衡量的应该是&quot;注意力正在往哪里迁移&quot;，而&quot;哪里注意力最多&quot;是另一个榜单。</strong>（&quot;相对热度/随时间变化&quot;这一度量方式与 Google Trends 的口径同类：后者同样以归一化到 0-100 的相对搜索兴趣而非绝对检索量呈现热度，来源：Google Trends, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_Trends\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_Trends</a>）</p>\n<p>但这个公式会被三类东西污染，必须各自处理。</p>\n<p><strong>长期稳定但缓慢增长的大词。</strong> 一个品类词的 7 日基线很高，即使日环比涨 30%，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">trend</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 也上不去——这其实是期望行为，大词的流量迁移应该去品类榜而不是热搜榜。但如果产品希望大词的显著变化也被捕捉，可以用两条榜合并：一条变化率榜 + 一条绝对量榜，各占若干槽位。</p>\n<p><strong>突发噪声（如前文的直播口误）。</strong> 需要&quot;增速的绝对值下限&quot;与&quot;增速的持续性要求&quot;双重过滤：连续 2 个统计窗口都在增长才进入榜单，且 24 小时检索量绝对值不低于某个下限（如 500 次）。单窗口的尖峰被丢弃。</p>\n<p><strong>恶意操纵。</strong> 刷热搜是真实存在的攻击（用脚本批量检索目标 query）。对策是把热搜的统计口径从&quot;检索次数&quot;换成**&quot;去重会话数&quot;或&quot;去重设备数&quot;**，并按设备/账号的贡献上限截断（单设备单 query 单日最多贡献 1 次）。这一步会让刷榜成本上涨几个数量级，因为需要真实的设备池。</p>\n<p>聚合管道的实现通常是流式的：原始检索事件按分钟窗口落进流处理作业，作业输出 <code>(market, query, window_count, distinct_devices)</code> 到一张中间表，另一个按小时调度的作业读中间表计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">trend</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、执行过滤、写最终榜单。榜单按市场分片——<strong>跨境电商的热搜必须是分市场的</strong>，一次欧美市场的促销不会也不应该出现在印尼市场用户的搜索框里。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE trending_board (&#10;  market        VARCHAR(8)   NOT NULL,&#10;  rank          SMALLINT     NOT NULL,&#10;  query_norm    VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;  query_raw     VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;  trend_score   DOUBLE       NOT NULL,&#10;  distinct_dev  INT          NOT NULL,   -- 去重设备数，抗刷榜的关键口径&#10;  computed_at   DATETIME(3)  NOT NULL,&#10;  state         TINYINT      NOT NULL,   -- 0=active 1=demoted 2=blocked&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (market, rank)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trending_board</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rank          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  query_norm    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  query_raw     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  trend_score   DOUBLE       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distinct_dev  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 去重设备数，抗刷榜的关键口径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  computed_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 0=active 1=demoted 2=blocked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (market, rank)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>state</code> 字段是运营接口的落点：<code>demoted</code> 是在保留统计的前提下从榜单隐藏（用于&quot;有争议但不违禁&quot;的事件），<code>blocked</code> 是完全排除（违禁、敏感、竞品品牌）。这两个状态必须能<strong>在不重新计算榜单的情况下</strong>即时生效，因此榜单读取时要做一次状态过滤，而不是把状态烧进排序结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"历史-本地优先-可清空-按时间与频次双衰减\">历史：本地优先、可清空、按时间与频次双衰减</h2><p>用户历史的经典价值是&quot;重复搜索&quot;——买过一次的东西会再买，常搜的类目会再搜。它的实现看似简单（存最近 N 条 query），但有四个容易被忽略的工程点。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，存本地还是存服务端。</strong> 首选本地（<code>localStorage</code> / 原生 App 的本地库）。三个理由：延迟为零（无需网络）；天然按设备隔离（家庭共享设备不会串号，而服务端按账号存会在共享账号场景下互相污染）；隐私上不构成&quot;数据收集&quot;。服务端只在用户显式开启跨设备同步时存，且必须支持删除。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，排序用时间衰减还是频次。</strong> 纯粹按最近时间排序会让一次性的偶然查询挤掉真正高频的意图。常见做法是两者的加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(q) = \\lambda \\cdot \\frac{freq(q)}{1 + freq(q)} + (1-\\lambda) \\cdot e^{-\\Delta t / \\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">freq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 是该用户的查询次数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 距最近一次的天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是天级半衰期（典型 14-30 天）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">freq/(1+freq)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把频次压进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 并且饱和——搜过 1 次与搜过 50 次的差距，远大于搜过 50 次与 100 次的差距。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的典型取值 0.4-0.6。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，必须过滤与去重。</strong> 历史里混着用户输入过程中的半成品（<code>iph</code>、<code>iphon</code> 是中间态，不是最终查询）、敏感查询（用户可能不希望别人看到）、以及已经被删除的商品 query。过滤规则：只记录&quot;产生了点击或回车&quot;的 query（中间态不记录）；过一遍敏感词表；对归一化后的形式去重保留最新展示形式。这一&quot;存归一化前缀而非原始输入&quot;的取向与 GDPR 第 5 条的数据最小化、存储限制原则一致（来源：GDPR Article 5, <a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-5-gdpr/\">https://gdpr-info.eu/art-5-gdpr/</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>第四，过期与容量。</strong> 本地存储有容量上限（通常几百条足够），按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 淘汰。用户清空历史时，不能只清展示列表——如果服务端也存了一份，必须同步发删除请求。<strong>清空按钮必须真的清空</strong>，这既是产品承诺也是合规要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"个性化-重排而非新增-并要能解释\">个性化：重排而非新增，并要能解释</h2><p>个性化在建议里的正确位置是<strong>重排已有候选</strong>，而不是凭空注入候选。理由：注入的候选项没有前缀/共现支撑，容易产生&quot;与我输入无关&quot;的感觉，用户感知为错误；而重排只改变顺序，风险低得多。</p>\n<p>有效的个性化信号有三类，按性价比排序：</p>\n<p><strong>市场与语言上下文。</strong> 最高性价比、最低隐私风险。用户在德国、界面是德语、当前市场是德国，那么德语候选和德国可配送商品应该优先。这甚至算不上&quot;个性化&quot;——它是上下文适配，但能解决大部分跨境场景的排序问题。</p>\n<p><strong>近期会话意图。</strong> 用户在本次会话刚看过&quot;登山鞋&quot;，那么输入 <code>鞋</code> 时运动类候选应该上浮。会话级信号短命、不落库、随会话结束消失，隐私成本极低。</p>\n<p><strong>长期画像。</strong> 品类偏好向量、价格带偏好、品牌偏好。收益最高也最需要治理：需要可删除、可解释（&quot;因为你常看运动户外&quot;）、并且要防窄化（长期只推一个品类会导致候选多样性崩塌，反过来降低采纳率）。</p>\n<p>实现上，个性化通常表现为对基础分的加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">score_{final} = score_{base} \\cdot (1 + \\beta \\cdot affinity(u, c)) \\cdot penalty_{diversity}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ina</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ini</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 控制个性化强度，必须可实验（典型从 0.1 起步，因为个性化过强会伤害新用户与探索行为）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">penalty_{diversity}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是无条件生效的多样性惩罚——它是防止&quot;整个下拉框都是同一类&quot;的护栏，在<a href=\"../quality-zero-result/suggest-ranking\">建议词排序</a>里有完整展开。</p>\n<p><strong>跨市场迁移的陷阱。</strong> 一个用户从美国站切到德国站，他的画像不应该原样迁移：他在美国买过的东西在德国可能不可配送，他的价格带偏好按美元建立、在欧元区意义不同。正确做法是画像<strong>按市场分区</strong>，跨市场只迁移最粗的品类兴趣，不迁移价格带与品牌偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冷启动与去重-三类来源的汇合点\">冷启动与去重：三类来源的汇合点</h2><p>一个新用户、新设备、新市场的组合下，三类来源会有两个退化：历史为空、个性化无画像。此时下拉框完全由热搜与前缀补全支撑——这恰好是<strong>冷启动场景下热搜价值最高</strong>的原因，因此热搜的分市场覆盖度是新市场上线时最先要保证的东西。</p>\n<p>三类来源汇合时必然产生重复。去重的键是归一化形式，保留优先级通常是：历史 &gt; 个性化重排结果 &gt; 热搜 &gt; 纯前缀补全（因为前三者已经过了用户行为验证）。但优先级不是固定的——同一条字符串如果既是用户历史又是当前热搜，展示时可以合并徽标（&quot;历史 · 热搜&quot;），这比二选一更有信息量，也是<a href=\"../quality-zero-result/suggest-analytics\">建议点击与采纳效果分析</a>里归因分析要区分的情况。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;输入为空 / 聚焦&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;本地历史&lt;br/&gt;时间+频次衰减&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;分市场热搜榜&lt;br/&gt;trend 排序 + 状态过滤&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;个性化画像&lt;br/&gt;按市场分区&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;候选合并&lt;br/&gt;按 norm 去重&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;重排已有候选&lt;br/&gt;affinity 加权&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;多样性护栏&lt;br/&gt;同类最多 N 条&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;下拉框&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;点击/采纳回流&lt;br/&gt;更新画像与热度&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"输入为空 / 聚焦\"] --&gt; B[\"本地历史&lt;br/&gt;时间+频次衰减\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"分市场热搜榜&lt;br/&gt;trend 排序 + 状态过滤\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"个性化画像&lt;br/&gt;按市场分区\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"候选合并&lt;br/&gt;按 norm 去重\"]\n    C --&gt; E\n    D --&gt; F[\"重排已有候选&lt;br/&gt;affinity 加权\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"多样性护栏&lt;br/&gt;同类最多 N 条\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"下拉框\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"点击/采纳回流&lt;br/&gt;更新画像与热度\"]</pre><p>回流那一步是闭环的关键：用户点了哪条、点后是否产生了订单，都必须回写。热搜要的是去重设备数、历史要的是本地频次、个性化要的是画像更新——<strong>三者的输入来自同一个点击事件，只是消费方式不同</strong>。这条回流管道一旦缺失，热搜会在几天内退化成陈旧榜单，个性化会退化成无画像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>热搜、历史、个性化的差异不在算法而在数据主体与生命周期，因此存储位置、失效策略、隐私治理必须分别设计。</li>\n<li>热搜必须按<strong>变化率</strong>而非绝对值定义，配以绝对量下限与持续性要求过滤突发噪声；抗刷榜的关键是把口径换成去重设备数。</li>\n<li>热搜榜必须分市场切分，且要有一键降权/屏蔽能力；状态过滤发生在读取时而非烧进排序结果。</li>\n<li>历史首选本地存储，用频次饱和项与时间指数衰减的加权排序；只记录产生了点击或回车的最终查询；清空按钮必须真正清空（含服务端副本）。</li>\n<li>个性化应表现为对已有候选的重排（affinity 加权 + 多样性护栏），强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 必须可实验；画像按市场分区，跨市场只迁移品类兴趣。</li>\n<li>新用户冷启动时下拉框由热搜与前缀补全支撑，因此分市场热搜覆盖度是新市场上线的首要保证。</li>\n<li>三类来源按归一化形式去重，保留优先级为历史 &gt; 个性化 &gt; 热搜 &gt; 前缀；点击事件同时回写热度、本地频次与画像，构成闭环。</li>\n<li>建议的下一步阅读：前缀约束如何被多语言输入改写见<a href=\"../multilingual-suggest/\">多语言建议</a>；候选排序的完整方法见<a href=\"../quality-zero-result/suggest-ranking\">建议词排序</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热搜、历史与个性化建议的来源与生命周期","id":"热搜-历史与个性化建议的来源与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类来源的共同结构与差异","id":"核心概念-三类来源的共同结构与差异"},{"level":2,"text":"热搜：用变化率而非绝对值定义\"热\"","id":"热搜-用变化率而非绝对值定义-热"},{"level":2,"text":"历史：本地优先、可清空、按时间与频次双衰减","id":"历史-本地优先-可清空-按时间与频次双衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"个性化：重排而非新增，并要能解释","id":"个性化-重排而非新增-并要能解释"},{"level":2,"text":"冷启动与去重：三类来源的汇合点","id":"冷启动与去重-三类来源的汇合点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"前缀补全、联想词与直达：三种建议形态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-autocomplete-suggestion/suggestion-types/prefix-completion-assoc"},"next":{"title":"商品建议与查询词建议的混合编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-autocomplete-suggestion/suggestion-types/product-query-suggest"}}